{"id":"NCT07023614","title":"A Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Ninerafaxstat in Patients With Symptomatic Non-obstructive Hypertrophic Cardiomyopathy","official":"A Global Phase 2b, Randomized, Double-Blinded, Placebo-Controlled Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Ninerafaxstat in Patients With Symptomatic Non-Obstructive Hypertrophic Cardiomyopathy - FORTITUDE-HCM","summary":"FORTITUDE-HCM is a global, multicenter, double-blind, parallel-group, placebo-controlled Phase 2b study that will assess the efficacy and safety of ninerafaxstat compared to placebo on top of Standard of Care in patients with symptomatic nHCM","conditions":["Non-obstructive Hypertrophic Cardiomyopathy"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Ninerafaxstat 200mg MR"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Select Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Has a clinical diagnosis of HCM consistent with current American College of Cardiology/American Heart Association and European Society of Cardiology Guideline definitions\n* Has had confirmation of nHCM by the echocardiography core laboratory based on screening rest and exercise stress echocardiography\n* New York Heart Association (NYHA) functional Class II or III at screening\n* Functional limitation as defined by a screening CPET\n\nSelect Exclusion Criteria:\n\n* Has a known or suspected infiltrative, genetic, or storage disorder causing cardiac hypertrophy that mimics nHCM\n* Has any other condition judged by the investigator to be the primary cause of dyspnea, exercise intolerance, and/or angina\n* Has an inability to exercise on a treadmill or bicycle (eg, orthopedic limitations)\n* Has any medical condition that precludes upright exercise stress testing\n\nOther protocol-defined inclusion and exclusion criteria apply.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":165,"start":"2025-10-06","pcd":"2026-12","upd":"2026-10-26","sponsor":"Imbria Pharmaceuticals, Inc.","areas":["other"],"central":["Medical Monitor · (617) 675-4060 · info@imbria.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"La Jolla","pr":"California","zip":"92037","s":"R","lat":32.8473,"lon":-117.2742,"c":"Study Coordinator · 858-246-5640"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Los Angeles","pr":"California","zip":"90048","s":"R","lat":34.0522,"lon":-118.2437,"c":"Study Coordinator · 6264094913"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"San Francisco","pr":"California","zip":"94143","s":"R","lat":37.7749,"lon":-122.4194,"c":"Study Coordinator · 415-476-2060 · Jonathan.Thomas2@ucsf.edu"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Washington D.C.","pr":"District of Columbia","zip":"20010","s":"R","lat":38.8951,"lon":-77.0364,"c":"Study Coordinator · 202-877-6334"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Miami","pr":"Florida","zip":"33136","s":"R","lat":25.7743,"lon":-80.1937,"c":"Study Coordinator · 7865785926"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Atlanta","pr":"Georgia","zip":"30322","s":"NYR","lat":33.749,"lon":-84.388,"c":"Study Coordinator"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Chicago","pr":"Illinois","zip":"60611","s":"R","lat":41.85,"lon":-87.65,"c":"Study Coordinator · 312-695-4067"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Oak Lawn","pr":"Illinois","zip":"60453","s":"NYR","lat":41.7109,"lon":-87.7581,"c":"Study Coordinator · 708.684.5137"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Baltimore","pr":"Maryland","zip":"21218","s":"R","lat":39.2904,"lon":-76.6122,"c":"Study Coordinator"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Boston","pr":"Massachusetts","zip":"02114","s":"R","lat":42.3584,"lon":-71.0598,"c":"Study Coordinator · 203-450-8273"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Burlington","pr":"Massachusetts","zip":"01805","s":"R","lat":42.5048,"lon":-71.1956,"c":"Study Coordinator · 781-825-8658"},{"f":"Imbria Investigational Site","city":"Grand Rapids","pr":"Michigan","zip":"49503","s":"R","lat"